  "published": "2026-08-09T07:46:12.16Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.9.0:\n• Add explicit target-side [NotifyAlso(NotifyFrom = true)] dependency declarations with transitive graph validation\n• Add typed On{Property}Changed(oldValue, newValue) post-change hooks with equality suppression and field/partial-property support\n\nv1.8.0:\n• Forward property-targetable field attributes with bound constructor and named values\n• Opt into direct child INotifyPropertyChanged notifications with NotifyOnSubPropertyChanged and NOTIFY010 guidance\n\nv1.7.0:\n• Generate C# 14/preview partial properties from [Notify] without a runtime dependency\n• Support [NotifyAlso] on partial properties and reject ambiguous generated names with NOTIFY009\n• Expand transitive [NotifyAlso] dependencies with cycle diagnostics (NOTIFY008)",
